To account for the noisy environment, the program includes a `System.Threading.Thread.Sleep(5000)` statement after sending each message. This pauses the program for 5 seconds before sending the next message, giving the students time to read and appreciate the message without being overwhelmed by the construction noise. You can adjust the length of the pause as needed. 
